  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I dislike the new menu/banner. I would like a way to go straight to all of my options. Escape menus are generally utility areas to get to the required options quickly. Having them hide in nested areas slows things down, plus once you click something it just reverts to the old UI format anyway.\nClicking the menu doesn't feel good, as it goes from this smallish menu to boom big in your face old-sized menu.\nIn VR we have a limited FOV and this banner just hogs up view real estate.\nI appreciate the effort and am okay with change but this seems like a half-completed change. When that's the case, some things are better left unchanged.",
